div(class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-6    ")
    p(class="sr-only", role="status", aria-live="polite", aria-atomic="true") {{cartAnnouncement}}
    header(class="flex flex-col gap-5   ")
        div
            p(class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#E96B2C]") Today only
            h1(class="mt-1 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#2F241D]") 오늘의 시장
            p(class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#7B6D62]") 오늘 아침 버틀러가 확인하는 상품의 시연 데이터입니다. 운영 시 재고와 마감시간을 구글 시트·DB와 연동합니다.
        div(class="relative w-full ")
            svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="1.8", class="pointer-events-none absolute left-4 top-1/2 size-5 -translate-y-1/2 text-[#998B80]")
                circle(cx="11", cy="11", r="7")
                path(d="m16.2 16.2 4 4", stroke-linecap="round")
            input(type="search", [(ngModel)]="searchText", (ngModelChange)="applyFilters()", placeholder="상품이나 점포를 검색해 보세요", class="h-12 w-full rounded-2xl border border-[#E2D6CB] bg-white py-3 pl-12 pr-4 text-sm text-[#2F241D] placeholder:text-[#A99C91] focus:border-[#E96B2C] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#E96B2C]/15")

    section(class="mt-7 overflow-x-auto pb-2")
        div(class="flex min-w-max items-center gap-2")
            button(*ngFor="let category of categories", type="button", (click)="selectCategory(category.name)", [class]="categoryClass(category.name)")
                span(class="text-base") {{category.icon}}
                span {{category.name}}

    section(class="market-list-banner relative mt-5 overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border border-[#E8D5C3] px-5 py-5 ")
        div(class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl")
            div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                span(class="rounded-full bg-[#2F241D] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-white") 시장 한정
                span(class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B5E3C]") 오늘 15:30 주문 마감
            h2(class="mt-2 text-xl font-black tracking-[-0.03em] ") 홍천의 대표 맛을 한 번에, 시그니처 상자
            p(class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#78685C] ") 홍총떡 · 올챙이국수 · 제철 산나물을 버틀러가 한 상자에 정성껏 담아드려요.
        a(routerLink="/posts/signature-box/detail", class="relative z-10 mt-4 inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-xl bg-[#E96B2C] px-4 text-xs font-extrabold text-white     ") 구성 보기
        div(class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-8 right-28 hidden text-[90px] opacity-80 ") 🎁

    div(class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4")
        p(class="text-sm font-bold text-[#51443A]")
            | {{filteredProducts.length}}개의 오늘 상품
            span(class="ml-2 text-xs font-medium text-[#998B80]") 마감 상품은 자동으로 숨겨져요.
        select([(ngModel)]="sortBy", (change)="applyFilters()", class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-[#DED2C7] bg-white py-1.5 pl-3 pr-8 text-xs font-bold text-[#5B4D42] focus:border-[#E96B2C] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#E96B2C]")
            option(value="recommended") 버틀러 추천순
            option(value="low") 낮은 가격순
            option(value="stock") 재고 많은순

    div(*ngIf="filteredProducts.length > 0", class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3   ")
        article(*ngFor="let product of filteredProducts", class="group min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-[#E7DCD2] bg-[#FFFDF8] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(70,49,33,0.10)]")
            a(routerLink="/posts/{{product.id}}/detail", class="block")
                div(class="relative flex aspect-square items-center justify-center overflow-hidden", [ngClass]="product.bg")
                    span(class="text-6xl transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 ") {{product.emoji}}
                    div(class="absolute left-2.5 top-2.5 flex flex-col items-start gap-1.5  ")
                        span(*ngIf="product.butlerPick", class="rounded-full bg-white/90 px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-extrabold text-[#2E7D32] shadow-sm ") ✓ 버틀러 픽
                        span(*ngIf="product.signature", class="rounded-full bg-[#2F241D] px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-extrabold text-white ") 홍천 시그니처
                    span(class="absolute bottom-2.5 right-2.5 rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-extrabold shadow-sm", [ngClass]="product.stock <= 5 ? 'bg-[#FFF1ED] text-[#C9492C]' : 'bg-white/90 text-[#6D5F54]'")
                        | {{product.stock <= 5 ? '품절 임박 ' : '재고 '}}{{product.stock}}개
            div(class="p-3.5 ")
                p(class="truncate text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#8B7E73] ") {{product.shop}} · {{product.cutoff}} 마감
                a(routerLink="/posts/{{product.id}}/detail", class="mt-1.5 block min-h-10 text-[13px] font-extrabold leading-5 text-[#2F241D] ") {{product.name}}
                div(class="mt-3 flex items-end justify-between gap-2")
                    p(class="text-[15px] font-black text-[#2F241D] ") {{product.price | number}}원
                        span(class="ml-1 hidden text-[10px] font-medium text-[#8B7E73] ") / {{product.unit}}
                    button(type="button", (click)="addToCart(product, $event)", class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FFF0DD] text-[#C65B1E] transition hover:bg-[#E96B2C] hover:text-white", [attr.aria-label]="product.name + ' 장바구니 담기'")
                        svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="1.9", class="size-5")
                            path(d="M12 5v14M5 12h14", stroke-linecap="round")

    div(*ngIf="filteredProducts.length === 0", class="mt-8 flex min-h-72 flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-[24px] border border-dashed border-[#DCCFC4] bg-[#FFFDF8] px-6 text-center")
        span(class="text-5xl") 🔎
        h2(class="mt-4 text-lg font-extrabold text-[#44382F]") 찾는 오늘 상품이 없어요.
        p(class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#8B7E73]") 다른 검색어나 카테고리를 선택해 보세요.
        button(type="button", (click)="resetFilters()", class="mt-5 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#2F241D] px-4 text-xs font-bold text-white") 전체 상품 보기

    section(class="mt-12 grid gap-3 border-t border-[#E5D9CE] pt-8 ")
        div(class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF8] p-4")
            span(class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#DFF3E2] text-xl") 🌱
            div
                p(class="text-sm font-extrabold") 오늘 상품만
                p(class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#8B7E73]") 매일 재고를 새로 확인해요.
        div(class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF8] p-4")
            span(class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#FFE6C9] text-xl") 👀
            div
                p(class="text-sm font-extrabold") 현장 검수
                p(class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#8B7E73]") 버틀러가 포장 전 확인해요.
        div(class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF8] p-4")
            span(class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#E6F0FF] text-xl") 🚚
            div
                p(class="text-sm font-extrabold") 배송 · 픽업
                p(class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#8B7E73]") 내 일정에 맞춰 선택하세요.
